# Pad 2 at layer 4 (M7 step 7.12; Makefile ci-arty-snes, ci-snes; ROM
# joy2.sfc): its two bytes at Snes.Machine.pad2Addr (160000h, low first),
# as the PS's relay writes the key word's bits 16-27 on a change (side
# track K's keys_hi): pad 2 = 0A5h, before joy2.s reads it (after 4
# frames; wait counts microseconds). The picture: green.
wait 20000
bytes 0x160000 A500
